Z||000010||hyhy4u||08-18-2001||10:50 AM||||<P>Test Performance Data From:<BR>Car and Driver<BR>Motor Trend<BR>Road and Track<P><BR>Model	Disp/bhp/cyl  0-60 mph.	¼ mile<BR>84 CP	2.5/92/4     12.5 sec	-<BR>84 SC	2.5/92/4     11.5 sec	-<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     12.7 sec	-<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     10.5 sec	17.7/75.2<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     11.6 sec	18.2/72.5<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     10.9 sec	18.1/74.0<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     11.3 sec	17.8/74.0<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     10.9 sec	17.9/73.8<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     10.9 sec	17.8/73.5<BR>84 SE	2.5/92/4     10.6 sec	17.8/73.5<BR>85 GT	2.8/140/V6   8.3 sec	16.2/84.2<BR>85 GT	2.8/140/V6   8.4 sec	16.5/84.5<BR>85 GT	2.8/140/V6   8.2 sec	16.0/85.0<BR>85 GT	2.8/140/V6   8.5 sec	16.2/83.8<BR>85 SD-4	2.7/180/4    6.3 sec	14.7/93.0<BR>85 GTU	2.7/275/4    4.0 sec	12.3/112<BR>86 GT	2.8/140/V6   7.5 sec	15.9/85.0<BR>86 GT	2.8/140/V6   8.4 sec	-<BR>88 GT	2.8/135/v6   7.8 sec	-<BR>88 Form	2.8/135/v6   8.0 sec	16.0/85.5<BR>88 GT	2.8/135/v6   8.7 sec	16.4/81.9<BR>88 Form	2.8/135/v6   7.9 sec	16.1/82.0<P>*the only auto is the Third one down..a 84 SE. All others are 4 or 5 Spds.<P>||||reg||1
